# .env.portals.example
# =====================
# Template for portal credentials.
# Copy this file to .env.portals and fill in the real values.
# .env.portals is GITIGNORED — never commit credentials.
#
# Convention: <PORTAL_KEY_UPPERCASE>_USERNAME and _PASSWORD
# Portal keys come from portals.yml.
#
# Copy and fill:
#   copy .env.portals.example .env.portals   (Windows)
#   cp   .env.portals.example .env.portals   (bash/zsh)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Portal: messer  (key from portals.yml)
MESSER_USERNAME=CHANGE_ME
MESSER_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME

# Portal: example_portal  (uncomment when added to portals.yml)
# EXAMPLE_PORTAL_USERNAME=CHANGE_ME
# EXAMPLE_PORTAL_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME
